### 1) register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Malaz",
  "lastName": "Hassan",
  "email": "malaz@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2) weak password (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "weak@test.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 3) login correct (expect 200)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "malaz@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 4) login wrong password (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "malaz@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}